  "source_context_assessment": {
    "october_2_direct_clinical_changes": "Article 1 replaces 2.4.2.A. Article 2 replaces ff and gg and adds aaaa under 4.2.14.C(3). Ravulizumab yyy and its pinned continuation checks are separate from these exact amended bends; a thiotepa zzz context anchor is not a new ravulizumab criterion. Remaining Articles 3-7 affect annexes, procedure/package/material rows or satralizumab listing. No reviewed direct amendment targets the listed sections/pinned named checks.",
    "october_3_regulation": "Separate Ilac Geri Odeme Yonetmeligi amendment, published in issue 33389; Article 8 makes it effective on publication (2026-10-03). Articles 1-7 concern internal-reference/equivalent groups, payable-unit-price bands, Medula data, committee membership, applications and market-share mechanisms. No disease-specific report, specialist, dose, test or clinical-eligibility criterion is amended by this text.",
    "october_2_annex_date_limits": "Article 4(b) is effective on publication with validity from 2026-09-05. Article 5 uses a separate five-day trigger; no numerical date is newly inferred. Article 6 EK-4/A has row-specific dates and marker-dependent triggers; rows and the separate pricing decision remain outside scope.",
    "exact_source_integrity": "Newly downloaded consolidated ZIP/DOCX hashes equal existing pins. All twelve family source_docx_sha256 and retained binding-file hashes were compared. No binding, corpus, clinical criterion, historical interval or lower bound was re-extracted or rewritten.",
